674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5II3bXVF8ZsQ7kNvwFmoseO&_nc_oc=Adq30GREeYW-KJKUvyQf8H5O_9q4Q6_HQ0sSMI4MZ687H99jGKkUA-kwawmtYUq0kHQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNEo2vQtzsLHaz7zomQKm_WgOIwBI2HJZZBCt8uI9Khfg&oe=6AE5FBD9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j6_NykVRN_IQ7kNvwGvDqkJ&_nc_oc=Adr3OsOxcRAqRbpEcjxOwHazYB-KXTvK9DAfiXAArPh5iXE86eHOgMBoD-b5w1I3OkY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOAapM24ydG86m7czng4exnDVFkjdIotn84vB52_lHZxQ&oe=6AE60496"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S5ZYI7xNfNQQ7kNvwGXN1qn&_nc_oc=AdqEK0tVHQ3XfhiPn98tX-anvsLqJTV-OUsrmzysvxNB5tj-OGgqUMSz4f7F2EUvMM4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPJWalU5PWYBwmyFXKd8hHRe8z0eadd-8BijIUgWsHY4g&oe=6AE600B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip